      "body": "\"-$600 of $1,300 risked\" is our shorthand for open P/L on the position: we're currently down about $600, against the maximum we could lose on the trade if it went fully against us. On this SPY 777/778 call spread we collected $3,150 in credit up front, and the worst-case loss is the $1 strike width \u00d7 100 \u00d7 150 contracts minus that credit \u2014 roughly $11,850 at risk. So the \"risked\" figure is the ceiling on the loss, and the dollar amount before it is where the mark sits today.",
